              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निवासयति (nivāsayati) is built from ni, \"down, in\", and the causative of the root √vas, \"to dwell\", which gives vasati, \"dwells\"; MW gives ni-vāsayati as to make stay, to receive as a guest, and KRM gives the causative participle vāsita (MW)."
